    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Argh\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "(So dizzy...! But I can see... and hear.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "(I can't feel... my ankle.)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "(It's so quiet. Where did everyone go?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "(......)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "(Silent as the grave... Did the rioters just leave me here?)"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "You're awake."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 6,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 30,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Aaah?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Calm down."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Oh, sorry! You startled me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Huh? You... I know you. You're from Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "GreyThroat, Operator."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Keep your voice down. We took care of the rebels in this area."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Took care of them...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Even at this point, you still don't see them as the enemy."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Relax, most of them are still alive. Handed over to Officer Severin Hawthorn."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "...Thanks."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Oh, um... What about Miss Folinic?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "She's fine. I sent another operator to help her. But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Did Atro really... sacrifice herself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "...Yes. I'm sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "That explains the way Folinic has been acting..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Just a few operators won't be able to retake this neighborhood on their own. We should fall back to the town center and regroup."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Right. Can you walk? You injured your ankle."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "I... I can try. Ow..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Here, let me help."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Thanks..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "One more question, Miss Tatjana. When I came here with Atro, Wolumonde was still thriving."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "So what happened to all the Gendarmerie? There isn't a single one left in town."
    },
