    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "The truly horrific thing about this disaster is that both sides are ordinary civilians. There are no warriors here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "We should do everything we can to avoid the worst case scenario."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "GreyThroat! Miss Tatjana! You're back!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "And we're going to make the murderer pay for their crimes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Tatjana!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Uncle... I'm sorry. I was careless..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "avg_npc_069#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "No... All that matters is that you're safe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "Operator Folinic. Glad to see you safe and sound."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "GreyThroat, I recall it was you who came with Atro to Wolumonde?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Do you know what happened?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "...I've got the gist of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Do you think... If you were with her, that things would've turned out differently?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Folinic, you shouldn't\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "No. The myriad contradictions this crisis has revealed in Wolumonde can't be solved by external forces. There is nothing we could've done."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "But at least... I should have been there with her, to do what I could."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I'm sorry. I'm sorry I wasn't with her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "No... *Sigh*. It was wrong of me to push that on you just to make myself feel better. What the hell am I doing...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "I'm the one who should be sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "People."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Let me start by offering my sincere thanks to Rhodes Island for saving Tatjana."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Rhodes Island is an organization dedicated to helping the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Severin Hawthorn, Leithanien is known for its lenient treatment of the Infected. But I still have to ask, before we get down to business\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "On behalf of Wolumonde, can you guarantee that Wolumonde has not, in light of these exceptional circumstances, taken 'additional measures' against the Infected population?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "The investigations you carried out with Miss Suzuran should have corroborated this."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Wolumonde has in no way, at no point, targeted the Infected. Nor have we ever held ill will toward Dr. Atro, who aided the Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Are you satisfied?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Miss Folinic, I believe Mr. Severin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Um... well... I'm not sure! But I do believe him! He wouldn't hurt Infected people!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Okay, Lisa. I'll trust your instincts, for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Thank you for understanding."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "Now, I'd like to hear your opinions on what to do next."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_066",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "I'm not as familiar with the field as Folinic. I followed her instructions during the operation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "There aren't a lot of them out there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Counting those we have successfully subdued, there can't be more than a hundred or so."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "A hundred or so rioters wouldn't be able to terrorize Wolumonde under normal circumstances."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "As for the Gendarmerie, I've heard some interesting rumors."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066",
            "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "That was one of the very few unfortunate decisions I've made in my military career. We can't do anything about it, so let's shelve it for now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Allow me to interject. I'd like to discuss that captive, who called himself 'Reunion.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
            "name2": "char_294_ayer",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "We have made contact with a certain lone member of the Reunion Movement, and he has very little in common with the outraged citizenry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "He's a battle-hardened warrior. And if he came with a squad, he could be a problem."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "The partisans. This is not good news."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Reunion..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Chernobog... Ursus... Gah... Not Ursus again..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_345_folnic_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 8,
            "ystrength": 6,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 60,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Folinic",
        "text": "Why should I believe a single word they say?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_367_swllow_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_294_ayer"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "The fire was the trigger for all of this. But there was always a high risk of conflict."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe",
        "text": "Did these underlying problems cause the fire? Or was this fire the catalyst that revealed these problems?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_069#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana",
        "text": "Do we have a choice...? Do we have to fight?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "This is the choice that decides the fate of Wolumonde. Thousands of lives hang in the balance. We can't be hasty."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_066"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Severin",
        "text": "We should return to the Rathaus for a formal resolution."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
